      "id": "2117267482289279279",
      "text": "Commodities are hugely cyclical.  It’s worth spending the time to understand the cycles and preparing a shopping list for the bad times when the world sours on them.\n\nBut, when you see huge margins and record profits it’s usually time to exit.  Rare exceptions occur when sector specific events allow margins to stay high for extended periods. Sometimes a sector can come into favour. The buyers become price takers for close to a decade.  \n\nI think the what we are seeing in copper, uranium, silver and oil… to name a few.  There’s also similar potential developing in minor metals.",
